Line 15: The field "age" is a number, but this is text.
    set rex's age to "four".
                     ^^^^^^

Line 16: I can't add text to a number.
    add "one" to rex's age.
    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
To join text, use "and" or "followed by".

Line 18: Only a record has fields, but this is a number.
    say count's name.
        ^^^^^
A field is part of a record, like "rex's name" for a dog called rex.

