    say rex is less than rex.
        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

Line 20: I can't add a number to a dog.
    say rex plus 1.
        ^^^^^^^^^^

Line 22: No kind of record has a field called "wingspan".
        say thing's wingspan.
                    ^^^^^^^^
